          {
            "name": "sgs/heading",
            "attributes": {
              "level": "h2",
              "content": "Questions",
              "fontSize": {
                "desktop": 30
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "sgs/text",
            "attributes": {
              "text": "<a href=\"#modal-size-guide\">Size guide</a> &nbsp; <a href=\"/contact/\">Contact me</a>",
              "textTransform": "uppercase",
              "fontSize": {
                "desktop": 13
              },
              "letterSpacing": {
                "desktop": 0.08
              },
              "linkColour": "text",
              "textDecoration": "underline"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "sgs/accordion",
        "attributes": {
          "accordionStyle": "flush",
          "allowMultiple": false,
          "defaultOpen": 0,
          "openIcon": "plus",
          "closeIcon": "x",
          "borderColour": "border",
          "headerColour": "text",
          "margin": {
            "desktop": {
              "bottom": "44px"
            }
          },
          "headerFontWeight": "400",
          "headerFontWeightOpen": "400"
        },
        "innerBlocks": [
          {
            "name": "sgs/accordion-item",
            "attributes": {
              "title": "Are these frames genuine?"
            },
            "innerBlocks": [
              {
                "name": "sgs/text",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "Yes. Everything comes through the brands' authorised UK suppliers to a GOC-registered clinic, boxed with its own case, cloth and warranty card. If a seller can't tell you where their stock comes from, be careful.",
                  "fontSize": {
                    "desktop": 15.5
                  },
                  "textColour": "text-muted"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "sgs/accordion-item",
            "attributes": {
              "title": "How are you cheaper than the high street?"
            },
            "innerBlocks": [
              {
                "name": "sgs/text",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "I'm one optician running one clinic, not a chain with regional managers and shopping-centre rents. I price from what a frame costs me rather than working back from the RRP, and I'd rather sell more pairs fairly than fewer at a markup.",
                  "fontSize": {
                    "desktop": 15.5
                  },
                  "textColour": "text-muted"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "sgs/accordion-item",
            "attributes": {
              "title": "Can I put prescription lenses in sunglasses?"
            },
            "innerBlocks": [
              {
                "name": "sgs/text",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "Yes, in any frame here. Choose “Add my prescription” on the product and the tint gets matched to the original lenses. Heavily wrapped sports frames and very strong prescriptions sometimes need a different approach — I'll tell you before anything is made.",
                  "fontSize": {
                    "desktop": 15.5
                  },
                  "textColour": "text-muted"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "sgs/accordion-item",
            "attributes": {
              "title": "What do I need for a prescription order?"
            },
            "innerBlocks": [
              {
                "name": "sgs/text",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "A prescription under two years old from a UK optician. Type it in, photograph it, or send it after you order. If your PD (pupillary distance) isn't written on it, I can measure it from a photo or in person.",
                  "fontSize": {
                    "desktop": 15.5
                  },
                  "textColour": "text-muted"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "sgs/accordion-item",
            "attributes": {
              "title": "How long do prescription lenses take?"
            },
            "innerBlocks": [
              {
                "name": "sgs/text",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "Seven to ten working days from receiving your prescription. Frames without prescription lenses go out within one working day.",
                  "fontSize": {
                    "desktop": 15.5
                  },
                  "textColour": "text-muted"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "sgs/accordion-item",
            "attributes": {
              "title": "How do I know which size to choose?"
            },
            "innerBlocks": [
              {
                "name": "sgs/text",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "Look inside the arm of a pair you already own — the first number is the lens width in millimetres. Most people are between 50 and 58. Unsure? WhatsApp me a photo of that number and I'll match it.",
                  "fontSize": {
                    "desktop": 15.5
                  },
                  "textColour": "text-muted"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "sgs/accordion-item",
            "attributes": {
              "title": "Can I return prescription sunglasses?"
            },
            "innerBlocks": [
              {
                "name": "sgs/text",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "Frames come back within 30 days if unworn. Lenses cut to your prescription can't be resold, so they're only refundable if I got them wrong — in which case I remake or refund them in full.",
                  "fontSize": {
                    "desktop": 15.5
                  },
                  "textColour": "text-muted"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "sgs/accordion-item",
            "attributes": {
              "title": "Can I collect and have them fitted?"
            },
            "innerBlocks": [
              {
                "name": "sgs/text",
                "attributes": {
                  "text": "Yes, and I'd rather you did. Choose “Collect in Birmingham” at checkout, I'll message when they're ready, and I'll adjust them to your face while you wait. No charge.",
                  "fontSize": {
                    "desktop": 15.5
                  },
                  "textColour": "text-muted"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
